WEBVTT

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:07.540
<i>He's stopped it!</i>

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:10.110
<i>Tsubasa defends the goal with his face.</i>

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:11.900
The ball is still alive!

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:13.200
We'll push it in!

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:19.290
<i>Is this the real strength of Tsubasa and the reigning champions, Nankatsu?</i>

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:22.660
<i>The Nankatsu that lack Wakabayashi and Misaki...</i>

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:27.820
<i>The Nankatsu that many people have challenged, yet failed to defeat.</i>

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:29.460
<i>Tsubasa as well...</i>

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:31.840
<i>No matter how much fighting spirit I show...</i>

00:00:32.390 --> 00:00:34.680
<i>No matter how much effort I put into it...</i>

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:37.010
<i>No matter how strong my allies are...</i>

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:43.850
<i>The prodigy of football, Tsubasa Ozora, won't I manage to overcome you after all?!</i>

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:49.190
<i>Don't stand up anymore, Tsubasa.</i>

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:50.850
All right, let's go!

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:52.990
<i>Nankatsu steals the ball now!</i>

00:00:52.990 --> 00:00:57.370
<i>It's the second half of extra time of the National Middle School Football Tournament's grand finals!</i>

00:00:57.370 --> 00:01:00.160
<i>Only five minutes remain!</i>

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:02.700
<i>The match is heading towards its conclusion!</i>

00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:07.920
<i>The only man I aspired to be... Tsubasa Ozora.</i>

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:11.090
<i>Please, someone tell me!</i>

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:14.220
<i>How can I catch up to Tsubasa?</i>

00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:18.970
<i>How can I become Tsubasa Ozora?!</i>

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:51.900
<i>Will Nankatsu be able to protect</i>

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:56.510
<i>the lead Tsubasa gave them in the first half of extra time with his Miracle Drive Shot?</i>

00:02:56.510 --> 00:02:59.670
Tsubasa, just a little more! Hang on!

00:02:59.670 --> 00:03:00.530
Yeah.

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:05.240
<i>Nankatsu truly fought and won their way through harsh battles in this tournament.</i>

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:10.080
Okay guys, let's score again and settle this at once!

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:16.090
<i>They've show their strength well in this final match against Toho, their greatest rivals!</i>

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:17.780
Damn!

00:03:17.780 --> 00:03:19.090
We can't take the ball!

00:03:19.540 --> 00:03:20.780
<i>I'm gonna lose...</i>

00:03:20.780 --> 00:03:22.810
<i>Am I going to lose this match?!</i>

00:03:22.810 --> 00:03:25.510
<i>Am I going to lose to Tsubasa, again?!</i>

00:03:25.510 --> 00:03:26.820
What's wrong, Hyuga?!

00:03:26.820 --> 00:03:27.650
Work your ass off!

00:03:27.650 --> 00:03:28.520
Matsuyama...

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:31.310
You are not the kind of man who'd let it end this way!

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:33.940
<i>If I can't become Tsubasa Ozora...</i>

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:42.070
<i>Then I need to become Kojiro Hyuga, and play the style of football that got me here, until the very end...!</i>

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:46.120
<i>Hyuga ferociously runs toward the ball.</i>

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:47.240
<i>But it's futile!</i>

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:50.290
<i>Running with all your strength won't earn you the ball...</i>

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:53.920
<i>So, Hyuga couldn't pass Tsubasa after all...</i>

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:00.010
Hyuga...

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:01.020
Captain...

00:04:01.020 --> 00:04:02.220
Damn!

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:06.300
<i>They all run together towards the ball, as Hyuga's inspired them!</i>

00:04:07.160 --> 00:04:08.810
<i>Sorimachi cuts the ball!</i>

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:09.690
Everyone...

00:04:09.690 --> 00:04:11.100
Captain!

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:13.810
Good!

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:16.770
<i>I need to play my own football.</i>

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:20.230
<i>I need to fight Tsubasa with my own football!</i>

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:24.780
Go Hyuga! Go Toho!

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:21.920
<i>Only 3 minutes remain in this match.</i>

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:24.780
<i>Will this be Toho's last attack in the finals?!</i>

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:29.580
We will play our football, Toho's football!

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:30.540
Yeah!

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:33.250
<i>Here he comes... This will be our final showdown.</i>

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:36.750
<i>Nankatsu choose a brilliant defensive formation here.</i>

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:41.630
<i>Hyuga uses his Straight-Line Dribble!</i>

00:04:41.630 --> 00:04:43.630
We won't give up any more goals anymore!

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:44.260
Stop him!

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:44.840
Yeah!

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:48.220
<i>A beautifully-executed one-two pass!</i>

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:48.950
Damn!

00:04:48.950 --> 00:04:49.970
As if we'd let you!

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:52.230
Hyuga!

00:04:52.230 --> 00:04:52.870
Takeshi!

00:04:52.870 --> 00:04:54.610
<i>Now it's Toho's Student-Teacher Duo!</i>

00:04:54.610 --> 00:04:56.690
<i>It's a one-two return pass from Sawada!</i>

00:04:57.440 --> 00:05:00.070
<i>Hyuga quickly finds himself in front of Nankatsu's goal!</i>

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:01.730
<i>Three minutes left!</i>

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:04.570
<i>Will this be the final shooting chance?</i>

00:05:09.430 --> 00:05:10.760
We won't let you score!

00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:13.160
We will protect this one goal lead Tsubasa gave us!

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:17.470
<i>A block, they formed a wall...</i>

00:05:17.470 --> 00:05:19.670
<i>You are doing a great job, Nankatsu.</i>

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:22.550
<i>It's my loss, Tsubasa.</i>

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:25.170
<i>I really can't win with my football style.</i>

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:26.230
<i>However...</i>

00:05:26.230 --> 00:05:29.100
<i>I will play my way until the very end, even if it makes me lose.</i>

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:30.830
<i>My football is about power!</i>

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:31.810
<i>I'll blow you away!</i>

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:35.110
<i>I will blow away Nankatsu's wall, and Tsubasa!</i>

00:05:35.110 --> 00:05:41.320
<i>I will entrust everything I and everyone in Toho have done up until this point to this right leg of mine!</i>

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:46.030
Go... my Tiger Shot!

00:05:46.460 --> 00:05:47.480
Don't, Hyuga!

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:49.280
A shot here won't lead to a score!

00:05:54.140 --> 00:05:55.960
<i>...That's it!</i>

00:05:57.160 --> 00:05:58.080
What?!

00:05:58.080 --> 00:05:59.430
Takeshi, your foot!

00:05:59.430 --> 00:06:01.340
Lift your foot this way!

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:02.000
Huh?!

00:06:02.600 --> 00:06:04.760
<i>Oh, this is...!</i>

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:06.090
Hyuga!

00:06:07.640 --> 00:06:11.010
<i>He jumped over them, using Sawada's foot!</i>

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:12.260
What?!

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:13.430
Hyuga!

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:17.480
Hyuga!

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:17.980
Captain!

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:18.480
Kojiro!

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:19.060
Brother!

00:06:20.460 --> 00:06:22.570
<i>This is Tsubasa's football...</i>

00:06:22.570 --> 00:06:26.070
<i>No, this is real football!</i>

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:34.970
Go, Overhead Tiger Shot!

00:06:34.970 --> 00:06:37.330
<i>Hyuga launches his shot!</i>

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:38.000
Hyuga!

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:38.390
Whoa...!

00:06:38.390 --> 00:06:41.080
<i>No one could ever stop this!</i>

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:46.630
<i>But it crashes right into the goalkeeper!</i>

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:50.130
<i>Oh, the ball is blowing the keeper away!</i>

00:06:50.890 --> 00:06:51.640
Tsubasa!

00:06:52.780 --> 00:06:55.420
<i>Tsubasa catches Morisaki!</i>

00:06:55.420 --> 00:06:58.140
<i>This guarantees Nankatsu's V3!</i>

00:06:58.140 --> 00:06:58.890
Oh!

00:06:58.890 --> 00:06:59.890
Tsubasa!

00:07:08.040 --> 00:07:09.190
<i>It's a tie!</i>

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:11.410
<i>Toho Academy ties the game!</i>

00:07:12.370 --> 00:07:17.890
<i>With just a minute left in the match, Toho finally managed to tie the score!</i>

00:07:17.890 --> 00:07:18.750
That's it!

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:22.100
<i>A blow that revitalizes them!</i>

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:23.500
Captain!

00:07:23.910 --> 00:07:25.150
<i>Kojiro...</i>

00:07:25.150 --> 00:07:28.510
<i>To think you'd do that much with a decision made in the heat of the moment...</i>

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:30.460
<i>You did really well, Hyuga.</i>

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:34.720
<i>Tsubasa is awesome too, but you are no less!</i>

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:36.850
<i>A nice shot, Hyuga.</i>

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:42.860
<i>I feel like I've come to understand why Tsubasa keeps fighting until his body gets battered just a little better.</i>

00:07:42.860 --> 00:07:45.650
It's because football is fun!

00:07:45.730 --> 00:07:47.940
<i>Each moment that you experience while you play,</i>

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:51.610
<i>you play, making your own decisions and ideas.</i>

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:53.740
<i>You'll be tied down by no one.</i>

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:56.950
<i>Yeah, football means freedom.</i>

00:07:57.480 --> 00:08:01.650
<i>While I mindlessly aimed for Tsubasa with my narrow ambitions,</i>

00:08:01.650 --> 00:08:06.910
<i>Tsubasa played football with the kind of big heart that I lacked.</i>

00:08:06.910 --> 00:08:09.210
<i>That's Hyuga for you.</i>

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:13.250
<i>Just as Tsubasa used his modified Drive Shot to score that goal,</i>

00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:16.480
<i>Hyuga modified his own Tiger Shot.</i>

00:08:17.440 --> 00:08:21.230
<i>Hyuga caught up to Tsubasa once again.</i>

00:08:21.230 --> 00:08:22.620
<i>It's 4-4.</i>

00:08:22.620 --> 00:08:24.940
<i>The match is, once again, back to square one!</i>

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:27.480
Hooray! Hooray! Nankatsu!

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:27.480
<i>One minute is left on the clock.</i>

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:30.080
<i>This final game does not have another extra time.</i>

00:08:30.080 --> 00:08:33.320
<i>Will both teams be declared winners, just like this?</i>

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:37.240
<i>Or will one of them be able to get that winning goal?</i>

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:40.040
<i>The match resumes!</i>

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:42.410
<i>Nankatsu commences their final attack.</i>

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:45.960
<i>Sorimachi immediately cuts the ball!</i>

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:46.830
Captain!

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:50.210
<i>The ball is sent to Hyuga.</i>

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:51.770
<i>One more minute.</i>

00:08:51.770 --> 00:08:54.550
<i>The shot I will take in this one minute will decide the result!</i>

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:55.600
We'll stop him!

00:08:55.600 --> 00:08:57.720
We need to stop him ourselves!

00:08:57.720 --> 00:08:58.600
Yeah!

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:00.230
Block his pass lanes as well!

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:02.300
Nice!

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:04.190
They can do their job even without Tsubasa.

00:09:04.190 --> 00:09:05.660
<i>He can't send a pass.</i>

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:08.020
<i>Hyuga is keeping the ball.</i>

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:09.270
Damn!

00:09:09.670 --> 00:09:11.940
<i>A little time's left on the clock!</i>

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:14.720
<i>There's no additional time in this extra time.</i>

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:18.220
There is no time left! Leave the defense, and attack with everyone!

00:09:18.220 --> 00:09:19.120
Yeah!

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:24.380
<i>He got past three of them!</i>

00:09:24.380 --> 00:09:25.290
Damn!

00:09:27.320 --> 00:09:30.260
<i>Nankatsu thoroughly keeps Hyuga in check!</i>

00:09:30.260 --> 00:09:32.090
<i>Will the time end like this?</i>

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:34.140
Guys...

00:09:34.140 --> 00:09:35.940
<i>Everyone is doing their best!</i>

00:09:35.940 --> 00:09:38.160
<i>I can do that as well!</i>

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:39.470
Tsubasa...

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:44.480
<i>A chance will appear for sure!</i>

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:45.600
Damn!

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:46.890
<i>Here it is!</i>

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:48.490
<i>He broke through!</i>

00:09:48.490 --> 00:09:50.310
<i>Hyuga makes his way forward!</i>

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:51.890
<i>I see it.</i>

00:09:51.890 --> 00:09:55.110
<i>The goal that will bring me—<i>us</i>—the victory!</i>

00:09:55.820 --> 00:09:56.870
Stop him!

00:09:56.870 --> 00:09:59.160
<i>Eat this and make it the last one!</i>

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:05.580
This is my... Final Tiger Shot!

00:10:05.940 --> 00:10:10.330
<i>Tsubasa, who was in front of the goal, appeared in Hyuga's path!</i>

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:12.330
<i>He's jumped to block!</i>

00:10:12.330 --> 00:10:14.090
<i>T-Tsubasa!</i>

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:19.800
<i>This one hits the bar!</i>

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:22.300
We got lucky!

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:26.640
<i>The ball hit Tsubasa's hair and its course changed!</i>

00:10:28.350 --> 00:10:32.310
<i>However, there is one player who hasn't given up yet.</i>

00:10:32.310 --> 00:10:37.650
<i>Tsubasa Ozora is heading towards the ball while being half conscious!</i>

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:40.860
Tsubasa!

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:41.610
Tsubasa!

00:10:41.610 --> 00:10:42.870
You are so...

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:44.120
Tsubasa!

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:48.370
<i>Tsubasa goes for a final Drive Shot gathering every ounce of strength he has left!</i>

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:49.250
Tsubasa!

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:52.130
The Prodigal Child of Football, Tsubasa Ozora!

00:10:52.130 --> 00:10:55.030
Will you be the one grasping victory after all?

00:10:59.180 --> 00:10:59.880
Hyuga!

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:00.970
Tsubasa!

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:19.070
<i>Hyuga proceeds to counter the Drive Shot with his Tiger Shot!</i>

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:20.860
Bro!

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:26.160
<i>Toho or Nankatsu? Whose goal will the ball go to in the end?</i>

00:11:35.360 --> 00:11:36.660
<i>It goes straight up!</i>

00:11:36.660 --> 00:11:39.170
<i>The ball sails right above them!</i>

00:11:39.170 --> 00:11:41.480
<i>That's what I'd expect from you, Tsubasa.</i>

00:11:41.480 --> 00:11:44.180
<i>To think that you'd be aiming to win right until the end,</i>

00:11:44.180 --> 00:11:48.020
<i>and try to fire a Drive Shot, even with your injured body...</i>

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:51.020
<i>That's just like you, Tsubasa Ozora.</i>

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:53.080
<i>Just as I'd expect from you, Hyuga...</i>

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:56.960
<i>You didn't let me score with my last Drive Shot.</i>

00:11:56.960 --> 00:12:00.500
<i>To think that you'd counter it with your Tiger Shot...</i>

00:12:00.500 --> 00:12:03.910
<i>You really are the Ferocious Tiger, Kojiro Hyuga.</i>

00:12:06.730 --> 00:12:08.180
<i>The match is over!</i>

00:12:08.180 --> 00:12:08.830
<i>The score's 4-4!</i>

00:12:09.530 --> 00:12:13.530
<i>Neither team managed to settle the score, and the game ends in a draw!</i>

00:12:13.530 --> 00:12:16.670
<i>With this, both teams will be declared as winners!</i>

00:12:17.110 --> 00:12:19.040
Is it over...?

00:12:19.040 --> 00:12:20.780
It is over...

00:12:24.630 --> 00:12:25.820
Is this the end?

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:27.600
A tie...

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:30.100
It's a draw...

00:12:31.920 --> 00:12:36.530
Even though it ended in a tie, Nankatsu got the first consecutive V3 in the tournament's history!

00:12:36.530 --> 00:12:38.010
It's our first victory!

00:12:38.010 --> 00:12:43.110
Toho V1! We're the first ones to get the title in the University, High School and Middle School sections!

00:12:43.110 --> 00:12:44.800
<i>They're both declared as champions.</i>

00:12:44.800 --> 00:12:47.780
<i>This outcome might be for the best.</i>

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:49.430
Tsubasa, we've got our V3!

00:12:49.430 --> 00:12:51.020
We did it!

00:12:51.020 --> 00:12:53.040
Our dream has come true!

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:54.780
Hyuga, it's our V1!

00:12:54.780 --> 00:12:57.710
We have won, captain!

00:13:00.020 --> 00:13:01.440
It's over...

00:13:08.780 --> 00:13:10.010
Tsubasa...

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:11.390
Hyuga...

00:13:14.010 --> 00:13:18.520
In our final match, in the end, I still couldn't beat you.

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:20.190
It's just a tie.

00:13:20.190 --> 00:13:27.700
No. In the second half of the match, if your Tiger Shots hadn't hit me and went directly to the goal like that,

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:30.990
Toho would have won this and become the champions alone.

00:13:30.990 --> 00:13:32.200
Tsubasa...

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:37.570
Thanks to that, I could keep on fighting until now without any regrets.

00:13:37.570 --> 00:13:40.300
Thank you, Hyuga.

00:13:40.300 --> 00:13:42.360
You're right.

00:13:42.360 --> 00:13:48.220
I ended up choosing my duel with you over the victory of my team.

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:51.490
I wanted to do this while you were in your best condition.

00:13:51.490 --> 00:13:53.680
Sorry, Hyuga.

00:13:56.340 --> 00:13:58.610
Hurry up and go to Brazil!

00:13:58.610 --> 00:13:59.480
Wha—

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:02.470
If you keep loitering around right in front my eyes,

00:14:02.470 --> 00:14:05.180
I'll end up aiming only for you.

00:14:05.180 --> 00:14:06.360
Hyuga!

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:10.400
But today, everything became clear to me.

00:14:10.400 --> 00:14:14.370
I understood a little more just how fun football can be.

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:18.470
From now on, I'll stop trying to catch up to you.

00:14:18.470 --> 00:14:21.380
I won't just try to beat you anymore.

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:27.010
From now on, I will aim higher, like you.

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:30.720
I don't know what that higher goal might be, yet.

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:33.590
Hyuga, I...

00:14:33.590 --> 00:14:37.230
When I graduate from middle school, I will go to Brazil!

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:38.770
Tsubasa...

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:43.860
With this, our battle is over for now.

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:45.400
Yeah.

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:46.990
Tsubasa...

00:14:46.990 --> 00:14:48.610
Hyuga...

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:09.710
<i>As a sign of their respect for each other, Hyuga and Tsubasa exchange their jerseys.</i>

00:15:09.710 --> 00:15:14.560
<i>After this game, both players are smiling, having played a match and leaving no regrets behind.</i>

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:20.660
<i>Eternal rivals...</i>

00:15:20.660 --> 00:15:22.900
<i>That's what Tsubasa Ozora and Kojiro Hyuga are.</i>

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:29.150
<i>They are also eternal football friends.</i>

00:15:32.040 --> 00:15:35.120
<i>The championship pennant will be presented now!</i>

00:15:38.920 --> 00:15:47.420
<i>The crimson championship pennant is handed to Nankatsu MS's Tsubasa Ozora and Toho Academy's Kojiro Hyuga.</i>

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:52.250
<i>According to both teams' joint decision, this championship pennant will be first taken to Toho Academy.</i>

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:55.510
<i>After 6 months, it will be given to Nankatsu.</i>

00:15:55.510 --> 00:15:57.740
So I'll be taking it first.

00:15:57.740 --> 00:15:58.700
Go ahead.

00:16:00.130 --> 00:16:04.360
<i>Hyuga holds the championship pennant high up in the air!</i>

00:16:04.360 --> 00:16:05.290
Hyuga!

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:05.920
Captain!

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:06.770
Captain!

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:11.530
<i>This is the championship pennant we all worked together to get.</i>

00:16:11.920 --> 00:16:13.280
Hyuga...

00:16:13.870 --> 00:16:16.860
<i>I've dreamed of seeing Kojiro happy like this.</i>

00:16:16.860 --> 00:16:20.700
<i>Kojiro has become the best in Japan for the first time!</i>

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:21.450
Bro!

00:16:21.450 --> 00:16:21.930
You did it!

00:16:21.930 --> 00:16:22.360
Kojiro!

00:16:22.360 --> 00:16:23.710
Congratulations!

00:16:24.380 --> 00:16:30.760
<i>After the presentation of the championship pennant, the 24 MVPs of the tournament are announced.</i>

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:38.300
<i>Tsubasa and Kojiro are at the top of the list; these players represent this generation of players.</i>

00:16:38.300 --> 00:16:39.810
Wakashimazu!

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:41.810
Morisaki, you've been chosen!

00:16:42.910 --> 00:16:45.400
What!? Have I been chosen too?

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:46.810
Oh, I've made it in!

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:52.450
Matsuyama, you've been chosen!

00:16:52.450 --> 00:16:53.490
Yeah.

00:16:53.880 --> 00:16:54.940
Wha—

00:16:54.940 --> 00:16:55.990
I did it!

00:16:57.410 --> 00:16:58.430
Captain!

00:16:58.430 --> 00:16:59.290
Yeah.

00:17:02.020 --> 00:17:04.460
Oh, we are both chosen, y'know!

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:05.370
Yeah!

00:17:05.760 --> 00:17:07.040
We're in there!

00:17:07.840 --> 00:17:10.620
<i>They will be invited to a training camp after this.</i>

00:17:10.620 --> 00:17:14.590
<i>Japan's representatives for the Junior Youth tournament will be chosen among them,</i>

00:17:14.590 --> 00:17:17.540
<i>and they will leave on a European tour.</i>

00:17:17.540 --> 00:17:19.030
Mr. Katagiri.

00:17:19.030 --> 00:17:19.680
Yes?

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:22.760
Will you let me join the representatives

00:17:22.760 --> 00:17:23.930
as a coach?

00:17:23.930 --> 00:17:26.400
Of course, I'd be glad to have you.

00:17:27.880 --> 00:17:29.000
<i>Misugi...</i>

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:31.610
Let's take a picture!

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:32.250
Okay, here I go!

00:17:32.250 --> 00:17:33.610
Yay!

00:17:33.610 --> 00:17:35.080
Hey, don't move!

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:38.740
CLUB RESIGNATION NOTICE

00:17:39.400 --> 00:17:40.740
Good job, everyone.

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:41.780
Coach!

00:17:41.780 --> 00:17:44.060
Oh, don't mind me!

00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:45.500
Well done!

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:47.790
It's the first championship for Toho Academy!

00:17:48.160 --> 00:17:49.280
Yeah!

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:51.000
We did it!

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:51.860
We finally did it!

00:17:51.860 --> 00:17:53.000
It's our V1!

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:54.300
Coach.

00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:56.840
Please accept this.

00:17:58.260 --> 00:17:59.140
Captain!

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:00.840
Hyuga!

00:18:00.840 --> 00:18:02.190
A club resignation notice?

00:18:02.190 --> 00:18:02.760
That's right.

00:18:02.760 --> 00:18:07.670
Even though I was the captain, I left the team without any notice and went to Okinawa.

00:18:07.670 --> 00:18:09.270
I'm taking responsibility.

00:18:09.270 --> 00:18:10.260
This can't be...

00:18:10.260 --> 00:18:11.400
Captain...

00:18:16.220 --> 00:18:18.530
You don't need to quit.

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:20.100
I'll be the one quitting.

00:18:20.100 --> 00:18:21.120
Coach?!

00:18:21.540 --> 00:18:24.760
My letter of resignation has been accepted by the chairman.

00:18:24.760 --> 00:18:28.040
When I strayed from my principles and decided to use you,

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:30.630
I had resolved myself to stop being Toho's coach.

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:34.770
However, we bacame champions thanks to that, Hyuga.

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:37.840
But, I won't stop dealing with football.

00:18:37.840 --> 00:18:42.290
Maybe I will see you as your opponent in a different school, next time.

00:18:42.290 --> 00:18:44.010
B-but, coach...

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:50.090
If you quit now, what will Wakashimazu, Sawada, and your other comrades

00:18:50.090 --> 00:18:52.480
who have been following you do?

00:18:53.040 --> 00:19:01.390
If you're so determined, take responsibility as their captain with your every move once you go into high school.

00:19:01.390 --> 00:19:04.040
That is your duty.

00:19:04.040 --> 00:19:06.120
Coach...

00:19:10.900 --> 00:19:13.250
Well, this meeting's over.

00:19:14.260 --> 00:19:16.810
Toho Academy Football Team! Get in line, all of you!

00:19:16.810 --> 00:19:17.960
Yeah!

00:19:20.380 --> 00:19:22.500
Bow to Coach Kitazume!

00:19:22.500 --> 00:19:24.640
Thank you very much!

00:19:28.740 --> 00:19:29.940
<i>Guys...</i>

00:19:30.940 --> 00:19:34.360
<i>I've been blessed with great disciples!</i>

00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:35.860
NANKATSU MIDDLE SCHOOL - SHIZUOKA PREFECTURE

00:19:36.740 --> 00:19:38.360
Does it still hurt?

00:19:38.770 --> 00:19:41.250
I feel a lot better.

00:19:41.250 --> 00:19:43.840
Thank you for everything, Manager.

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:48.120
Tsubasa, get well soon.

00:19:49.090 --> 00:19:50.020
Tsubasa!

00:19:50.020 --> 00:19:51.450
Let us thank you.

00:19:51.450 --> 00:19:52.370
What?

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:54.440
Our dream has come true.

00:19:54.440 --> 00:19:57.300
We'll graduate from middle school without a single loss in 3 years.

00:19:57.300 --> 00:20:00.180
If you had gone to Brazil, it wouldn't have come true.

00:20:00.180 --> 00:20:01.700
That's not true, guys.

00:20:02.130 --> 00:20:05.120
I didn't make your dreams come true.

00:20:05.120 --> 00:20:06.890
We all made them come true together!

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:08.080
Tsubasa...

00:20:08.080 --> 00:20:09.680
I see... That's how it is.

00:20:09.680 --> 00:20:10.380
We did it!

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:11.100
Yes!

00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:12.560
Oh yes, we did it!

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:14.810
We did it! It's our V3!

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:16.570
Yeah!

00:20:17.010 --> 00:20:19.570
<i>I've seen everything clearly from the start.</i>

00:20:19.570 --> 00:20:23.360
<i>These guys are the golden generation that will connect us to the world.</i>

00:20:23.360 --> 00:20:25.630
<i>The Golden Age.</i>

00:20:25.630 --> 00:20:28.400
<i>You'll be playing on the world stage from now on.</i>

00:20:28.400 --> 00:20:29.910
<i>Help each other,</i>

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:34.380
<i>and spread your wings on the grand stage of the world next time.</i>

00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:37.870
<i>Nankatsu and Toho
become the joint champions.</i>

00:20:51.970 --> 00:20:54.480
<i>have embarked on a training camp.</i>

00:20:55.000 --> 00:20:59.360
<i>Because of the injuries he sustained during the Nationals, Tsubasa Ozora is not there.</i>

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:04.650
In his stead, Shun Nitta from Otomo
Middle School is participating as an exception.

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:07.800
We have some really
amazing players here, right?

00:21:07.800 --> 00:21:08.890
You're right.

00:21:09.990 --> 00:21:12.140
Are we still short of
the necessary pieces?

00:21:12.140 --> 00:21:14.320
It's true that we've
gathered great players.

00:21:14.320 --> 00:21:16.880
However, if he were here...

00:21:16.880 --> 00:21:18.260
You have a point.

00:21:18.260 --> 00:21:20.640
Then this could be an incredibly strong team.

00:21:20.640 --> 00:21:22.420
That's how I feel.

00:21:22.420 --> 00:21:24.930
Wow, this is pretty cool!

00:21:25.330 --> 00:21:26.350
Guys.

00:21:27.470 --> 00:21:30.340
Why no one is
wearing this one?

00:21:31.220 --> 00:21:33.340
Isn't it obvious?

00:21:33.340 --> 00:21:35.980
We have to keep it for him.

00:21:35.980 --> 00:21:37.650
That's right.

00:21:37.650 --> 00:21:40.860
But we're still
missing one jersey, aren't we?

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:44.410
Using my authority as the coach,
I gave one to Katagiri.

00:21:44.410 --> 00:21:45.360
What?

00:21:45.960 --> 00:21:46.860
That means...

00:21:52.010 --> 00:21:53.660
Hey, that's dangerous!

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:56.120
You'll hurt yourself if you miss a step!

00:21:56.120 --> 00:21:57.390
It's all right!

00:21:57.390 --> 00:21:59.250
The ball is my friend!

00:21:59.960 --> 00:22:02.050
Isn't that right, Tsubasa?

00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:04.900
<i>Tsubasa Ozora and Taro Misaki...</i>

00:22:04.900 --> 00:22:09.890
<i>We can't have the new representatives of Japan without the Golden Duo.</i>

00:22:20.190 --> 00:22:22.820
It's in! The Fire Shot!

00:22:24.620 --> 00:22:28.840
So you've improved your shot to a whole new level, Schneider!

00:22:31.240 --> 00:22:34.230
<i>Tsubasa, the world's so vast!</i>

00:22:34.230 --> 00:22:35.830
<i>There are amazing players everywhere!</i>

00:22:36.780 --> 00:22:41.340
<i>You should leave Japan soon and spread your wings, Tsubasa!</i>

00:22:43.450 --> 00:22:47.260
<i>I'm so glad that I moved to Nankatsu.</i>

00:22:47.770 --> 00:22:52.590
<i>I couldn't realize my dream of leaving here with Roberto 3 years ago,</i>

00:22:52.590 --> 00:22:57.020
<i>but that's why I made a new dream come true with everyone.</i>

00:22:57.600 --> 00:23:01.480
<i>But this time, I will go to Brazil.</i>

00:23:01.480 --> 00:23:03.770
<i>The kingdom of football, Brazil...</i>

00:23:03.770 --> 00:23:09.200
<i>The country of the person who taught me the joy of football, Brazil...</i>

00:23:12.360 --> 00:23:15.320
<i>I will go to Brazil and become a pro there.</i>

00:23:17.220 --> 00:23:21.290
<i>Even if I make one dream come true, the story won't end there.</i>

00:23:22.080 --> 00:23:25.550
<i>One day, I'll become the #1 professional football player.</i>

00:23:25.550 --> 00:23:29.050
<i>Then I'll be in the Japanese National Team, and become #1 in the world...</i>

00:23:29.050 --> 00:23:32.360
<i>I will make all my dreams come true!</i>

00:23:34.140 --> 00:23:36.100
Go!
